{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11301400","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11301400","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130140001:1":{"text":"아르사와 소렌은 우르 촌락에서 능력이 가장 뛰어난 사람들이에요.","source_cn":"阿尔萨和索恩确实是乌尔聚落最厉害的存在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42F752D0B7E0CD2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130140002:1":{"text":"하지만 사막엔 우르 부족만 있는 게 아니니까요. 부족마다 그 부족을 대표하는 강자가 있는 법이죠.","source_cn":"可荒漠中的部落却不止乌尔一个，每个部落都会有各自的强者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFA05F896D4CBBFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130140003:1":{"text":"소렌과 아르사가 시련에서 다치지 않았으면 좋겠어요.","source_cn":"希望索恩和阿尔萨在试炼里不要受伤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D2FE6AD709E289A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小蛮血瑟拉芬":{"text":"세라핀","source":"小蛮血瑟拉芬","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}